Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:00.470 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  the internet has been obsessed with  spider-man no way home since it became  public knowledge rumblings of a  potential crossover with tom holland  andrew garfield and toby maguire's  incarnations of the titular wall crawler  have led fans to believe that this could  be one of the single most incredible  marvel cinematic universe installments  to date it remains to be seen if there's  any truth to such rumors at this point  but we do know that villains from all  three live-action spider-man franchises  are coming to the marvel cinematic  universe to give holland spider-man a  run for his money as revealed in the  first snowway home trailer doctor  stranger's attempt to use magic to  change peter parker's life for the  better has apparently gone terribly  wrong now spidey and the sorcerer  supreme have to contend with a myriad of  dangerous villains from across the  multiverse all while trying to send them  back to their respective timelines  electro and lizard represent the amazing  spider-man continuity with sandman dark  ark and green goblin carrying over from  director sam raimi's spider-man trilogy  the second trailer for spider-man no way  home gave fans a best look yet at all  five of these bad guys in action however  fans couldn't help but notice an odd  detail about the green goblin that has  laid the groundwork for an interesting  fan theory when green goblin first  appears in the most recent spider-man no  way home trailer he looks exactly the  same as he did in 2002's spider-man  wrapped in his jade armor complete with  his signature goblin mask he stands atop  his glider with a pumpkin bomb in hand  however norman osborne seems to try out  a brand new ensemble at some point in  the film goggles replace his helmet  additional armor sits on his arms and  legs purple accents cover his neck and  chest and he rides a redesigned glider  has the iconic spiderman foe gotten some  upgrades in the mcu or is something else  going on in no time at all twitter has  become entranced with this green goblin  situation so naturally theories have  already arisen  according to rotten tomatoes they're not  the same and this version of the  character will appear alongside the one  made famous in spider-man in trying to  sort out their true identity another  user posits that this could be a tweak  design for dame de haan's green goblin  from the amazing spider-man 2. meanwhile  another fan speculated that we may be  looking at mysterio using osborne's tech  to become a unique take on the hobgoblin  who are you  and where did you get all of those  weapons  it's all very compelling stuff and it  would make sense given the maximalistic  approach to the spider-man film cannon  that is being taken by no way home but  we should still brace ourselves for the  possibility that the solution is  significantly less thrilling  spider-man no way home has had a  particularly engaging roll out for fans  who love to analyze trailers and behind  the scenes speculation  from the early birds about the film's  ambitions to the ever still popular hunt  for definitive proof that toby maguire  and or andrew garfield will be returning  reading the proverbial tea leaves is  becoming as exciting as the movie itself  those who have been deep in the web of  no way home theories and alleged leaks  have seen some of those predictions come  true but perhaps that has made us all a  little too susceptible to seeing things  that aren't there we still can't say for  sure exactly what the answer to this  latest green goblin riddle is but we do  need to address the possibility that the  most obvious solution may also be a  disappointingly simple one in a piece  for slash film jeremy mathie proposes a  theory about the second green goblin  suit that is as logical as it is  unexciting as he lays it out if main  characters going through multiple  costume changes and a given superhero  movie is a time on a trope then it's not  the biggest stretch to imagine a villain  doing the exact same thing  so even if the blurry figure from the  trailer is indeed a different version of  the green goblin suit that doesn't  necessarily mean that it's a different  green goblin wearing it but thigh argues  that the second suit could merely be the  result of osborne sustaining enough  battle damage that he will end up  needing to rely on a backup more cobbled  together suit for future encounters  later in the film we'll all just have to  wait until spider-man no way home hits  theaters on december 17th to know for  sure  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite tv shows and movies are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]

